message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and the software via the DOI below."
type: software
title: "tb-plasma-emission: pipeline for tuberculosis detection from plasma-emission images of exhaled breath"
abstract: "Source code for the BSPC 2026 paper on tuberculosis detection from plasma-emission images of exhaled breath, captured by the BDEE-Device. Includes preprocessing, classical baselines (Random Forest, SVM), CNN architectures with transfer learning (ResNet-50, EfficientNet-B0, MobileNetV2), Grad-CAM interpretability, blob-cropping ablation and PEVA/PESC domain-shift analysis."
